OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud across
OL,6,Fthe west of the region but clearer in
OL,7,Fthe east through the evening. Becoming
OL,8,Fovercast overnight with patchy light
OL,9,Frain developing. Rain turns more
OL,10,Fpersistent, locally heavy with the
OL,11,Fpotential for thunder into the
OL,12,Fmorning. Mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FOvercast with rain, locally
OL,15,Fheavy or thundery with gusty winds,
OL,16,Fimproving by early afternoon with rain
OL,17,Fturning light and patchy. Cloud breaks
OL,18,Finto the evening with a cold night
OL,19,Ffollowing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
