OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,6,Fand sunny on Thursday after a chilly
OL,7,Fstart. Cloudier with outbreaks of rain
OL,8,FFriday. Chilly with early fog patches
OL,9,Fon Saturday, becoming breezy with
OL,10,Fsunny spells later.
